        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>ABH L019 Extra Heavy Door Intermediate Door Pivot Set</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThese 3/4\" offset intermediate pivots are engineered for durability on extra heavy doors or lead lined doors. Set includes intermediate pivot with installation hardware. <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=519415\"><b>ABH Door Pivots</b></a> are Made in the USA to insure high quality. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese are used in conjunction with <a href=\"/products/extra-heavy-door-pivot-hinge-set-abh-l0147\"><b>ABH L0147 Extra Heavy Door 3/4 Inch Offset Pivot Set</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ABH-L019_size.gif?v=1704354709\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ABH L019 EXTRA Heavy Door Intermediate Pivot Set Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for ABH L019 Intermediate Door Pivot\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Offset: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: Up to 1000 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Leaf Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Leaf Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Hinge Width: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Type: Full Mortise</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with needle bearings</li>\r\n<li>US32D model UL listed for use on 3 hour fire doors</li>\r\n<li>BHMA/ANSI C07321/3525</li>\r\n<li><b>Handed - Must specify left hand door or right hand door when ordering</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/L019-install.pdf?v=1691093121\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH L019 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/L019-template.pdf?v=1691093122\" target=\"new\"><b>ABH L019 Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this pivot hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
